{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_204_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_204","textTraditional":"一、二十有四年。春王二月丙戌，仲孫貜卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_204_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_204","textTraditional":"二、叔孫舍至自晉。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_204_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_204","textTraditional":"三、夏五月乙未朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_204_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_204","textTraditional":"四、秋八月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_204_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_204","textTraditional":"五、丁酉，〈木巳〉伯鬱釐卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_204_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_204","textTraditional":"六、冬，吳滅巢。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_204_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_204","textTraditional":"七、葬〈木巳〉平公。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}